Add NIC sensor configuration to enable sensor monitoring.

[1] Gerrit: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/88680

Tested:
```
root@bmc:~# busctl tree xyz.openbmc_project.EntityManager | grep -e "IOB[0-3]_NIC"
          │ ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/NVIDIA_VR_NVL72_IO_Board_0/IOB0_NIC0_OSFP_TEMP_C
          │ ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/NVIDIA_VR_NVL72_IO_Board_0/IOB0_NIC0_PWR_W
          │ ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/NVIDIA_VR_NVL72_IO_Board_0/IOB0_NIC0_TEMP_C
          │ ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/NVIDIA_VR_NVL72_IO_Board_0/IOB0_NIC1_OSFP_TEMP_C
